    "description": "This dataset contains graphs that quantify the response of heart tissue to periodic pulses during ventricular fibrillation. Files with names that start with activation show the maximum activated area, those starting with synchronization show the synchronized area fraction. The data of each file is from a single experiment; denoted by the date in the filename. For details on the measurements and the analysis please refer to the PhD thesis by H. tom W\u00f6rden given in the references.",
